{"title":"AIME Problems and Solutions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This is a list of all <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AIME\">AIME</a> exams in the AoPS Wiki.  Many of these problems and solutions are also available in the AoPS community's <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3416\">AIME problem collection</a>.  If you find problems that are in the AIME problem collection that are not in the AoPS Wiki, please add them.  Also, if you notice that a problem in the Wiki differs from the original wording, please correct it.  Finally, additions to and improvements on the solutions in the AoPS Wiki are always welcome.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Year</th>\n<th>Test I</th>\n<th>Test II\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2027\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2027_AIME\" title=\"2027 AIME\"> AIME</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_I\" title=\"2026 AIME I\"> AIME I</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II\" title=\"2026 AIME II\"> AIME II</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AIME_I\" title=\"2025 AIME I\"> AIME I</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AIME_II\" title=\"2025 AIME II\"> AIME II</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2024</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_I\" title=\"2024 AIME I\"> AIME I</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AIME_II\" title=\"2024 AIME II\"> AIME II</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2023</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I\" title=\"2023 AIME I\"> AIME I</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II\" title=\"2023 AIME II\"> AIME II</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2022</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_I\" title=\"2022 AIME I\"> AIME I</a></td>\n<td><a href=